# valid/race-loser-before-winner-publication
profile own
scope.begin caller async
scope.begin race
new loser_input L
future loser void - bound loser_input
future winner new W bound
future.start loser
await result winner
future.cancel loser
check L
cache.rehome winner caller
exit.prepare race result
scope.end race
exit.commit race caller
use result
scope.end caller
